cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: "kh-hivp-hpv: a reproducible workflow for whole-genome HPV sequencing analysis"
abstract: >-
  Nextflow workflow for the analysis of HPV sequencing data, from read
  taxonomic binning and genotype assignment through consensus generation to
  phylogenetic trees, sublineage assignment, recombination screening and
  single-nucleotide variant analysis.
type: software
authors:
